      <title>U.S. breaks record for its most gold medals won at a Winter Olympics</title>
      <link>https://www.nbcnews.com/video/u-s-breaks-record-for-its-most-gold-medals-won-at-a-winter-olympics-258087493885</link>
      <description>The U.S. Olympic team won its record-breaking 11th gold medal of the Winter Games on Saturday, with at least one more possibility tomorrow when the U.S. men's hockey team wraps up the action ahead of the closing ceremony with the title game against Canada. NBC News’ Shaquille Brewster reports from Milan, Italy.</description>
